   "he": "לֹא הָיוּ כּוֹנְסִין אוֹתָן בַּחֲצָבִין גְּדוֹלִים, תָּנָא: חָבִיּוֹת כַּדִּיּוֹת לוּדִיּוֹת וּבֵינוֹנִיּוֹת.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: When people produced wine for libations «they would not collect» the wine «into large barrels,» as it causes the wine to spoil; rather, it would be placed in small casks. The Sages «taught» in a baraita: The «casks» referred to by the mishna are «flasks» that are made in «Lod and» that «are medium-sized.»"
  }
